  2. MACHINE-READABLE SPECIFICATION SURFACE          MPL-2.0
     Everything under .machine_readable/ (A2ML descriptiles, contractiles,
     K9 configurations, anchors, policies), 0-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml, the package
